===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The act of [[progressing]] or [[proceeding]]
# A [[group]] of people or thing moving along in an [[orderly]] manner, especially if doing so [[slowly]] and [[formally]]
# A number of things [[happening]] in [[sequence]] (in [[space]] or in [[time]])

